2026-10-03T12:47:47.7116921Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7216412Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7226417Z [0m
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7227057Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7227918Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7228316Z 
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7228541Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7229349Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7229668Z 
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7229872Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7230277Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7230479Z 
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7230878Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [30001..30008])[0m and groups [34m(gid 30000)[0m
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7231574Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7232088Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7232470Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7232646Z 
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7232853Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7233143Z 
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7233364Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7233774Z    can use Nix.
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7233924Z 
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7234040Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7234214Z 
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7234498Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7234984Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7238787Z 
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7239075Z I will:
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7239666Z 
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7240002Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7240571Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7241035Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7241459Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7241775Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7242074Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7242705Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7243398Z    /root
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7253127Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7254009Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7264264Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7264964Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7265469Z 
2026-10-03T12:47:47.7266454Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
